# Project Structure

## Root Directory

```
tennis_coach_app/
├── .cursor/rules/          # Cursor IDE rules
├── backend/                # FastAPI backend application
├── frontend/               # React frontend application
├── data/                   # Application data storage
├── docs/                    # Project documentation (diagrams, assets)
├── ml_models/              # YOLO model files
└── README.md               # Project overview
```

## Backend Structure

```
backend/
├── app/
│   ├── api/
│   │   ├── routes/          # API endpoints
│   │   └── schemas/         # Pydantic models
│   ├── core/
│   │   ├── config.py        # Configuration
│   │   └── database.py      # Database setup
│   ├── models/              # SQLAlchemy models
│   ├── services/            # Business logic
│   └── main.py              # FastAPI app
├── docs/                    # Documentation
│   ├── api.md              # API reference
│   ├── database_schema.md  # Database schema
│   └── ...
├── alembic/                 # Database migrations
├── tests/                   # Test files
└── pyproject.toml           # Project configuration
```

## Data Storage

```
data/
├── analysis_cache/          # Cached analysis results
├── database/               # SQLite database files
└── videos/                 # Video file storage
    ├── processed/          # Processed videos
    └── raw/               # Original videos
```

## Documentation

- **Backend API**: `backend/docs/api.md`
- **Database Schema**: `backend/docs/database_schema.md`
- **Project docs**: `docs/` (architecture diagrams in `docs/diagrams/`, assets in `docs/assets/`)

## Key Files

- **`backend/app/main.py`**: FastAPI application entry point
- **`backend/app/core/config.py`**: Environment variables and settings
- **`backend/app/core/database.py`**: Database connection and session management
- **`backend/pyproject.toml`**: Python project configuration and dependencies

## Module Responsibilities

- **`api/`**: HTTP request/response handling
- **`core/`**: Application configuration and database setup
- **`models/`**: Data models and database schema
- **`services/`**: Business logic and external integrations
- **`utils/`**: Shared utility functions
